            undefined
            undefined"><div class="undefined TruncatedText TruncatedText_line-4__CGy8m Overview_OverviewDescriptionTruncText__KLEw7 
                 " data-testid="text-custom">Ahuja Altus is a premium residential project in Worli, developed by Ahuja Constructions. This exclusive development offers spacious 3 BHK luxury homes, designed for modern, upscale, and comfortable living. With thoughtfully planned layouts, expansive living spaces, and high-quality construction, the project delivers a refined urban lifestyle. Strategically located in one of Mumbai’s prime locations, Ahuja Altus ensures excellent connectivity to major business hubs, premium social infrastructure, and key destinations, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers seeking luxury residences and investors looking for high-value real estate opportunities in a prestigious locality.</div></div></div><div class="Overview_OverviewGrid__OKQXI false"><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Configuration</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">3 BHK</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Ready to move</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Completed in Jan 2025</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Avg. Price</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">₹52,002/sq.ft</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">RERA Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">1523 - 1550 sqft</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="Overview_ListContainer__RcPDE "><div class="Overview_highlightHeading__8JSvd">Why consider <span>buying this property</span>?</div><div class="Overview_HighlightsContainer__cYf_c"><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Premium Residential Project in Worli.</li><li>Designed for modern, upscale, and comfortable living.</li><li>Ensures excellent connectivity to major business hubs.</li><li>Provides a perfect blend of location, luxury, and exclusivity.</li></ul><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Offers spacious 3 BHK luxury homes with elegant layouts.</li><li>Located in a prime South Mumbai residential locality.</li><li>Close to top schools, hospitals, and lifestyle destinations.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="Amenities"><div class="Amenities_Amenities__Idw7g" data-testid="blox-Amenities"><div class="Amenities_AmmCard__Gu2e5 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="Amenities_AmenitiesHeadingTxt__bxyH0 squarebx rightPos"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm "><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Amenities</div></h2></div><div class="Amenities_amenitiesDesktop__NRcWU"><div class="Amenities_TagGrid__rI9__"><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/cctv-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg"/><div>CCTV / Video Surveillance</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/gym-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg"/><div>Gymnasium</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="a