 style="height:auto;width:100%" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderCtn__mGuOf CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 FAQCard_cardHeadingCls__4XVWK  squarebx rightPos" data-testid="card-header"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderTitle__GzXgr CardHeader_CardHeaderTitlePrimary__vjpXN gheader"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 FAQCard_cardHeading__Y4AcV"><div class="undefined  " data-testid="text-custom">Frequently Asked Questions</div></h2></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">When is the possession date for Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">Possession date of Ahuja Altus is 26 Jan 2025</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What is the RERA carpet area range of Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The RERA carpet area range for Ahuja Altus is 1523 - 1550 sqft</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What is the price range of Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The price range of Ahuja Altus is ₹7.92 Cr - 8.06 Cr</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Where is Ahuja Altus located?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">Ahuja Altus is located at Ahuja Altus, Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Kamagar Nagar Number 1, Century Mills, Lower Parel, Worli, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400030.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What configurations are available in Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">Ahuja Altus has 3 BHK configurations.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What is the status of Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The status of Ahuja Altus is Ready to move.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Which amenities are provided in Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Home Automation, Indoor Games, Intercom Facility, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Party Lawn, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area, Yoga Area.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Who is the developer of Ahuja Altus?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The developer of Ahuja Altus is Ahuja Constructions.</div></div></div></div></section><section id="Developer"><div class="DeveloperInfo_DevInfo__z4GBW DeveloperInfo_Darktheme__ON7C5" data-testid="blox-DeveloperInfo"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm DeveloperInfo_cardHeading__SkJEX squarebx"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">About The Developer</div></h2><div class="GridCont_gridCont__rn4P3  GridCont_row__HRG7b GridCont_center__7YNM7" style="grid-gap:20px;justify-content:flex-start"><div class="DeveloperInfo_DevlogoBox__pRcPe"><img alt="Developer for Ahuja Altus:Ahuja Constructions" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="DeveloperInfo_DevLogo__mXnC6" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/280122034540-123123123123.png"/></div><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm DeveloperInfo_cardHeading__SkJEX"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-4__YAMBJ" data-testid="text-custom">Ahuja Constructions</div></h2></div><div class="undefined DeveloperInfo_DevText__0bBIr text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Ahuja Constructions is a renowned name in the field of Real Estate, with a stellar reputation since its inception. The company has earned its place among the leading conglomerates through its unwavering commitment to excellence and innovation. Over the years, it has gained extensive expertise in the Real Estate industry and has become synonymous with quality and reliability.

Ahuja Constructions has successfully completed over 40 prestigious projects in cities like Pune and Mumbai, showcasing its dedication to providing extraordinary living experiences to its discerning clientele. With an array of ongoing projects, the company continues to raise the bar in terms of innovation and quality. Their team comprises seasoned professionals from various domains who collaborate on every project, leaving no room for compromise when it comes to delivering the highest standards of quality and comfort for residents.</div></div></section><div data-testid="same-area-prop-ctn"><div class="SameAreaProperties_SameAreaPropertiesCtn__qfNU_ Card_primary__IiLET Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderCtn__mGuOf CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 SameAreaProperties_CardHeader__EDw78" data-testid="card-header"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderTitle__GzXgr CardHeader_CardHeaderTitleSecondary__w6GWM gheader"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 "><div class="undefined  " data-testid="text-custom">Properties In The Same Area</div></h2></div><div class="CardHeader_CardIconCtn__IwxSE "><img alt="bloxsquare" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg"/></div></div><div><div class="swiper Swiper_SwiperCtn__bi0fK SameAreaProperties_SwiperClass__tmPO8"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide Swiper_SwiperSlide__BWsJ2 SameAreaProperties_SwiperSliderClassName__IpLlP"><div class=" PropertyCard_PropertyCardCtn__yVyLN " data-testid="propertycard-ctn" style="width:296px;height:480px"><a class="HiddenLinksSEO" href="/projects/godrej-trilogy-seaturf"></a><img alt="Property-Image" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" data-nimg="fill" class=" PropertyCard_PropertyCardImage__9Zvsn" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0